<title>SRI LANKA: Blue Diamonds says 9-mth net falls 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Blue Diamonds says 9-mth net falls 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Blue Diamonds Jewellery Worldwide Ltd for nine months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		  1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	  543.88    vs	658.58</p>
<p>     Net profit	151.43    vs	170.26</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue chip Blue Diamonds Jewellery makes diamond and gem-studded gold jewellery mainly for export.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
